Author: Lore Agent <lore-agent@re-cinq.com>
Date:   Thu Sep 17 15:21:57 2026 +0000

    feat(tools): validate tool input against inputSchema in ToolRegistry

    Add ajv v8 to dependencies and implement input validation inside
    ToolRegistry.execute. Static schemas are compiled at register time so
    a broken schema fails at startup; function-valued sources are compiled
    per call and cached by schema object identity via WeakMap. A
    schema-invalid call returns a ToolResponse naming the failing path and
    constraint (values are never included), leaving the executor uncalled
    so the model can read the rejection and retry within the tool-round
    budget. Throws for unknown tool names are unchanged.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

